# Installation Instructions

Select your platform:

@tabs
@tab "Windows"
## Windows Installation

1. Download the installer
2. Run the `.exe` file
3. Follow the wizard

```bash
# Or with npm
npm install -g markup-plus-js
```
@end

@tab "macOS"
## macOS Installation

```bash
# Using Homebrew
brew install markup-plus-js

# Or with npm
npm install -g markup-plus-js
```
@end

@tab "Linux"
## Linux Installation

```bash
# Using apt
sudo apt install markup-plus-js

# Or with npm
npm install -g markup-plus-js
```
@end
@end
